        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 6,
      "text": "For the State : Mr. Shailesh Kr. Sinha, A.P.P.\n---\n03/18.05.2023 Heard the Parties.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 449,
      "end": 533,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Shailesh Kr. Sinha",
          "label": "LAWYER",
          "start": 470,
          "end": 488
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 7,
      "text": "Petitioner is apprehending his arrest in connection with Chakradharpur P.S. Case No.32/2023, for\nthe offences registered under Sections 376(3) and 313 of the Indian Penal Code and Sections 4(2) of\nthe Pocso Act, pending in the court of learned Additional Sessions Judge- cum-Special Judge,\nPocso Act, West Singhbhum at Chaibasa.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 534,
      "end": 863,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Chakradharpur",
          "label": "GPE",
          "start": 592,
          "end": 605
        },
        {
          "text": "P.S. Case No.32/2023",
          "label": "CASE_NUMBER",
          "start": 606,
          "end": 626
        },
        {
          "text": "Indian Penal Code",
          "label": "STATUTE",
          "start": 693,
          "end": 710
        },
        {
          "text": "Pocso Act",
          "label": "STATUTE",
          "start": 736,
          "end": 745
        },
        {
          "text": "Additional Sessions Judge- cum-Special Judge,\nPocso Act, West Singhbhum at Chaibasa",
          "label": "COURT",
          "start": 779,
          "end": 862
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 8,
      "text": "Petitioner is said to have established consensual physical relationship with the victim.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 865,
      "end": 953,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 9,
      "text": "She became pregnant, petitioner administered her with drugs for abortion.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 954,
      "end": 1027,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 10,
      "text": "She was taken to hospital in very critical stage, her uterus was on the verse of rupture due to which she was operated and fetus was removed.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 1028,
      "end": 1169,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 11,
      "text": "Mr. Shailesh Kr. Sinha, learned A.P.P. has pointed out that statement of the doctor, who had performed her operation has been recorded in the case diary.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 1170,
      "end": 1324,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Shailesh Kr. Sinha",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 1175,
          "end": 1193
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 12,
      "text": "The doctor has supported the fact that the victim was administered drugs for miscarriage due to which she was in a very critical stage and she had to be operated.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 1325,
      "end": 1487,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 13,
      "text": "Victim is a minor girl aged about 16 years.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 1488,
      "end": 1532,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 14,
      "text": "Consensual physical relationship of the victim with the petitioner is meaningless.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 1533,
      "end": 1615,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 15,
      "text": "She was also administered drugs for abortion by the petitioner.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 1616,
      "end": 1679,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
